{'symbol': 'TRMB', 'date': '2022-01-18 06:30:00', 'title': "TRIMBLE INTRODUCES INDUSTRY'S FIRST HORIZONTAL STEERING CONTROL FOR SOIL COMPACTORS", 'text': "SUNNYVALE, CALIF. , JAN. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRIMBLE (NASDAQ: TRMB) ANNOUNCED TODAY HORIZONTAL STEERING CONTROL FUNCTIONALITY ON THE TRIMBLE® EARTHWORKS GRADE CONTROL PLATFORM FOR SOIL COMPACTORS, THE INDUSTRY'S FIRST AUTOMATIC STEERING CONTROL SOLUTION FOR SOIL COMPACTORS—AND THE NEXT STEP TOWARDS TRIMBLE'S AUTONOMOUS VISION."}